+Date: Tue, 19 Aug 2025 11:22:24 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH 4/7] AOSCOS: Disable LASX by default for libyuv.
+
+We are starting to have powerful mobile and embedded chips that
+lack LASX capabilities, namely 3B6000M and 2K3000.
+---
+ media/libyuv/libyuv/libyuv.gyp | 5 +++++
